msgid "IfcPerformanceHistory"
msgstr "Performance History"

msgid "IfcPerformanceHistory_DEFINITION"
msgstr "_IfcPerformanceHistory_ is used to document the actual performance of an occurrence instance over time. It includes machine-measured data from building automation systems and human-specified data such as task and resource usage. The data may represent actual conditions, predictions, or simulations."

